{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"switzerland-net-salary-calculator UI copy.example","detected_language":"nl","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"switzerland-net-salary-calculator.copy.example","keys":["switzerland-net-salary-calculator.copy.example"],"locale":"nl","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Voor CHF ZXQPH0000QXZ per salarisbetaling en ZXQPH0001QXZ betalingen, jaarlijkse bruto is CHF ZXQPH0002QXZ.Federal werknemersbijdragen worden geschat op basis van het jaarsalaris; voer jaarlijkse plan en belastingaftrek in om het netto scenario te schatten.","record_id":"343759e48cb5f0a3cc9efc90f0c558edec53af7cc86e3a492022c27c8f484a93","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40565692987","seconds":1.5351414602499744,"source":"For CHF 8,000 per salary payment and 13 payments, annual gross is CHF 104,000. Federal employee contributions are estimated from the annual salary; enter annual plan and tax deductions to estimate the net scenario.","source_commit":"e8a7cb94dc75d40f2c0e14bb27c0a1819e230012","source_hash":"c305bab964cd5b62b3c806c67e40540f06fd3c051f35325139793a5ac4fb9370","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Voor CHF 8,000 per salarisbetaling en 13 betalingen, jaarlijkse bruto is CHF 104,000.Federal werknemersbijdragen worden geschat op basis van het jaarsalaris; voer jaarlijkse plan en belastingaftrek in om het netto scenario te schatten.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
